Exact source
------------

Source URL:        @SOURCE_URL@
Source tag:        @SOURCE_REF@
Source commit:     @SOURCE_COMMIT@
Source tree:       @SOURCE_TREE@
Source date epoch: @SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH@

The corresponding source is the complete source tree at the commit and
tree above. It can be obtained from the source URL and, where applicable,
from the referenced tag. The archive itself is a binary distribution and
does not contain the full source tree.

Build identity
--------------

Target:            Windows x86_64
Runtime contract:  single PE, statically linked MinGW-w64 runtime,
                   system UCRT provided by Windows
Builder baseline:  Windows 11, MSYS2 UCRT64
Compiler:          GCC/MinGW 16.2.0 Rev7 (gcc 16.2.0-7)
Runtime packages:  mingw-w64-ucrt-x86_64-gcc-libs 16.2.0-7,
                   mingw-w64-ucrt-x86_64-winpthreads
                   14.0.0.r598.ge3d18511f-1,
                   mingw-w64-ucrt-x86_64-crt 14.0.0.r598.ge3d18511f-1
Linker setting:    -Wl,--no-insert-timestamp
Build command:     make release BUILDROOT=<portable-root>
                   CXX='g++ -static -static-libgcc -static-libstdc++
                   -Wl,--no-insert-timestamp'
Minimum platform:  x86-64 Windows 10/11 with the Universal C Runtime
Runtime DLLs:      KERNEL32.dll and api-ms-win-crt-*.dll from Windows

The executable does not require libstdc++-6.dll, libgcc_s_seh-1.dll,
libwinpthread-1.dll, msys-2.0.dll or xfoil_next.dll. Extract the archive
contents into a directory of your choice and run `xfoil.next-cli.exe`. No
installation step is required.

